{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":246925,\"title\":\"Ne'ma, The Lawyer\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Madly in love with her no-good husband, a skilled lawyer goes above and beyond to help him. But when she discovers he’s cheating on her, she plots her revenge.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c68sx6jwADFWnjSWdxKcpiH5yLi.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tmeptl3o7eLzVEWVJE7NfmIuT2f.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":16,\"createdBy\":[\"Mohamed Samy\"],\"networks\":[\"MBC Shahid\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"EG\",\"name\":\"Egypt\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-03-26\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1852467,\"name\":\"Mohamed Samy\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPrHjmTDoN00PS2aHRJqhzgBeec.jpg\"},{\"id\":1865634,\"name\":\"Mai Omar\",\"character\":\"نعمة\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/52e4H8J66b2jMBSt9SrlQgisirB.jpg\"},{\"id\":1164724,\"name\":\"Ahmed Zaher\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hbhHnt2G2FBFS3HNfwjGc0klL5O.jpg\"},{\"id\":1172376,\"name\":\"Arwa Gouda\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j4G85Ddx2E0Lr6zXNcviCx9jkFs.jpg\"},{\"id\":3500271,\"name\":\"Kamal Abo Raya\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1EktBy2LmZjKaldAjBObiISq4D8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1164888,\"name\":\"Salwa Othman\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/75uA46kdbm9GdmR3a6TK2S8lFEC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1165454,\"name\":\"Sami Maghouri\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/675TmIEoWDqpHYF5BCe0moimtXr.jpg\"},{\"id\":2495473,\"name\":\"Lobna Wanas\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nG3TOOaWYsBpLEWjo12VrydCaMQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":3116199,\"name\":\"Emad Zeyadah\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2120144,\"name\":\"Tarik Al-Nahry\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h1vFZ7tTQ0i3c7p4xHavvuDi0FC.jpg\"},{\"id\":3542897,\"name\":\"Ahmed Maged‎\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5gyyXeaAybTfO9pDQgV5clqqgIS.jpg\"},{\"id\":3500278,\"name\":\"Walaa Elshrif\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l4xNEryZdMsQsjSpeIZP8OtQ5gR.jpg\"},{\"id\":4635795,\"name\":\"Mohamed Desoky\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1162381,\"name\":\"Reem Raafat\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3mEzrJbeN1thlUdnMaPI86nlcdW.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"aQjTbPBgPSE\",\"name\":\"إعلان مسلسل نعمة الأفوكاتو | رمضان معانا | شاهد\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4iZyDVnpDVnfBmhYyv4ZFITK7EX.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2024-03-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Between her lazy husband, retired father, and broke friends, Ne’ma’s life isn’t easy. But her kindness and generosity pay off when she lands a lucrative case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dOKTY86RK0f7WiCtbzb2AFhVVIN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-11\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"In an effort to improve Salah's life, Ne’ma gives him a portion of the money, only to discover his selfish nature. Later, Kamal offers her a job at his company.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sM5c6cNwC15XJ6WnFs2j0gzNtX5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-12\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma can’t shake her doubts about Salah’s activities after his arrest. Salah visits his lawyer Khaled, only to find Sarah flirting with him. Ne’ma starts her new job.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/evV9s0XJEuFPk4muMDIaAQOGHDs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-13\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma is torn about revealing the truth to Salah, unaware that those she trusted with her secrets are about to betray her. Salah asks Medhat for advice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xCGl88X3uuxQtI7HC8QeObDrKCx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-14\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma is furious upon learning who is following her. When Said and Mahroussa are robbed, Ne’ma goes looking for the thief.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1vgyOj0blzYIE3rbKo91LJpuK24.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-15\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Prompted by Ne’ma, Khaled tells Salah the truth. Ne’ma finds out who robbed her father. Now that he’s rich, Salah’s relationship with Sarah develops fast.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bLrxGe2rN4bB0B8SEhJeQrVXoF0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-16\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Salah and Sarah frantically try to conceal their tracks. Later, Salah starts to build his cover story.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/65NpPGL3ZEBBpUskfNbMvF7lUjo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-17\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Salah gets rid of his final loose end. Just as her father and friends hit rock bottom, Ne’ma reenters their lives and starts planning her revenge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/73LLvt4LB7YJ8mRY6LT6zjMzH1h.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-18\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma confronts Sarah and Salah and starts reclaiming what is rightfully hers. Salah considers going on the offensive and getting rid of her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/caQorIG8LSkb08Hfk6OHZjLhV3Y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-19\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma kicks Nawal out of her apartment. Salah and Sarah hire Medhat to do their dirty work. Magda asks Ne’ma for help.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3TBvpbpWyCJOJ3OcpUtioyZ5hnI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-20\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma plants the seeds for the next phase of her revenge and employs Yasine’s help. Medhat blackmails Salah.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fqduU2RbQ1U5cRvMuqXMv7WD6LA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-21\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Sarah and Salah fall into Ne’ma’s trap. Akram and Mariam have a fight. Ne’ma and Yasine grow closer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qPboEBZScby7eiQ7GSrVeSKxNIO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-22\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"Ne’ma confesses to Menna about what truly happened to Mohamad. Later, she goes up against Khaled in court. Sarah tries to keep up her charade with Salah.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dPgHh9ctQrwjjRXdVIG14e79xom.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-23\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"While Ne’ma continues to enact her plan, Yasine pays her father a visit and makes a special request. Medhat tries to get the money Ne’ma owes him, but she outsmarts him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wQMH8cRxwHNqXFaNdWcGF5L2bIo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-24\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"Magda confronts Ne’ma, who is forced to reveal the truth. Salah struggles to stay ahead of Ne’ma. Sarah tries to swindle Yasine.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCYGnVHkGmBWGCkI07DX3M4S3oJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-25\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"SEASON FINALE: After learning she’s pregnant, Ne’ma faces a difficult choice. Ne’ma having manipulated them both, Salah and Sarah’s issues reach a boiling point.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nnszpW30U0ZERSEzBjvEMUFNWzh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-26\",\"runtime\":83}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2024-03-11\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}